{"id": "syssifoss-arboretum", "title": "SYSSIFOSS arboretum — 11 trees, 6 species", "description": "Terrestrial laser scan (RIEGL VZ-400) of single trees from Central European mixed forest plots near Bretten and Karlsruhe. 11 trees (1× sycamore maple, 1× Douglas fir, 2× Norway spruce, 2× European beech, 2× red oak, 1× sessile oak, 2× Scots pine). SYNTHETIC arrangement on a 16 m grid: the original locations are spread over ~20 km. Geometry, height and diameter of every tree are unchanged — an arboretum for comparing species. Colouring = the dataset's manual leaf/wood separation (green = leaf/needle, brown = wood, ground truth); DBH is fitted from wood points only. No panorama in the dataset. Source: SYSSIFOSS, heiDATA doi:10.11588/DATA/UUMEDI, CC BY 4.0.", "created": "2026-07-30T09:14:25+00:00", "pano": null, "thumb": "scenes/syssifoss-arboretum/thumb.jpg", "width": null, "height": null, "variants": [], "source": {"type": "syssifoss-tls", "origin_xyz": [21.818181818181817, 14.545454545454545, 0.0], "dataset": "SYSSIFOSS single trees, leaf-wood separated (RIEGL VZ-400)", "url": "https://doi.org/10.11588/DATA/UUMEDI", "license": "CC-BY-4.0"}, "pointcloud": {"bin": "scenes/syssifoss-arboretum/cloud_lite.bin", "count": 160000, "bbox_min": [-26.0528621673584, -21.28994369506836, -1.4450000524520874], "bbox_max": [33.0428581237793, 22.740907669067383, 46.17525100708008], "levels": [{"id": "lite", "label": "Thinned", "bin": "scenes/syssifoss-arboretum/cloud_lite.bin", "count": 160000, "bbox_min": [-26.0528621673584, -21.28994369506836, -1.4450000524520874], "bbox_max": [33.0428581237793, 22.740907669067383, 46.17525100708008], "bin_url": "media/scenes/syssifoss-arboretum/cloud_lite.bin"}, {"id": "full", "label": "Full", "bin": "scenes/syssifoss-arboretum/cloud.bin", "count": 700000, "bbox_min": [-26.070112228393555, -21.28419303894043, -1.496000051498413], "bbox_max": [33.05085754394531, 22.80040740966797, 47.267250061035156], "bin_url": "media/scenes/syssifoss-arboretum/cl